# Verification

During iteration / before individual commits:

- Run only focused tests covering changed files plus `tsc --noEmit`.
- Code-intelligence scans when touching shared contracts:
  `ast-grep scan --config sgconfig.yml src server scripts e2e` and
  `npx depcruise --config .dependency-cruiser.cjs src server scripts e2e`.

Before delivery:

- `npm run check`, `npm run build`, `git diff --check`, plus both scans.
- `npm run gate:codex` is advisory evidence, not the delivery gate.
- Delivery evidence is green GitHub Actions on the exact head;
  report degraded gates instead of claiming them passed.
- `通过` authorizes commit + push of the approved batch only.
  Merge / tag / release / deploy each need separate explicit approval.
